From 2274b3083f718eed5133b4e34bfd7ecd88cb71db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 04:37:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] retain own admitted runs with durable stop-only
 decision custody

Add registered kanban_retain with immutable first-wins transport, canonical evidence confirmation and exact local claim settlement. Preserve refusal and scope restrictions, cumulative spend, source custody and incomplete dependency state. Split unchanged sync wire translation to keep the source-size ratchet.

Proof: Board PR196 a8c4c106 deployed before emission. Registered real rc0 child through gateway result writer and dispatcher exits legally; retained receipt, transport, readers, accounting and shared integrations pass. Scope is B1 only; universal B2 and historical operator backfill remain separate.
